Note on the dataset

The traffic this project analyses is SYNTHETIC. It is generated by
`generator/generate.py` from a fixed seed and contains no real Bitcoin addresses,
no real IP addresses and no personal data. The generator is distributed under the
same licence as the rest of the Software.
